Settings — Full UI redesign

We are now redesigning the entire Settings window.

The four supplied mockups are the visual target, not general inspiration.

The goal is to reproduce their layout, hierarchy, spacing, cards, controls, typography, icons and overall visual language as closely as reasonably possible while preserving the existing Bootcade functionality.

Do not redesign the mockups. Do not simplify them back into the current GTK Settings UI.

